<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX FALLS ONE PERCENT TO END AT 1,539.74PTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX FALLS ONE PERCENT TO END AT 1,539.74PTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell 16.24 points or 1.04 percent to 1,539.74 points on Monday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech,</p>
<p>Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040.</p>
